<title>UK: WestHyp adds 100 mln marks to 5-year step-up bond.</title>
<headline>WestHyp adds 100 mln marks to 5-year step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 200 million marks from 100 million marks, lead manager Commerzbank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFAELISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *200 MLN	 COUPON   **4.0	 MATURITY  **13.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.25    PAY DATE    13.MAR.97</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 LISTING    DUES	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES    **CALLABLE 13.MAR.98, WHEN COUPON THEN STEPS UP TO</p>
<p>		4.25 PCT, 5.0 PCT IN YR 3, 5.25 PCT IN YR 4 AND 6.0</p>
<p>		PCT IN YR 5.</p>
<p>	     *ORIGINAL 100 MLN MARK DEAL LAUNCHED 14.FEB</p>
</text>
